Data preprocessing
For each bacterium under study, a dataset with their respective antibiotic resistance profile was constructed. Following the recommendation of Ref.
42
, duplicated samples were removed to reduce any bias. Accordingly, null values were removed. As suggested in
41
,
45
, a matrix was constructed ranging from 2000 to 9999 Da. The data were aggregated in blocks of 5 bins, resulting in 1600 columns. As a result, four datasets were constructed.
